     <DIV class=WordSection1>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; MARGIN: 3.05pt 13.05pt 0pt 6.95pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; TEXT-INDENT: 31.9pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT face=宋体><FONT size=5>为进一步提高试用期教师的政治思想水平、职业道德修养和<SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt">教育教学能力，使新教师更好地适应教育教学工作，定于 </SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>3<SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -2pt"> </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -2pt">月 </SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>15 </SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt">日下午组织 </SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.15pt">2016</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.65pt"> </SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.65pt">年市直学校新教师实践培训。现将有关事项通知如下：<SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<H2 style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 39.1pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT face="Microsoft JhengHei">一、培训时间及地点<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></H2>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="MARGIN: 1.2pt 0cm 0pt 38.85pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT face=宋体><FONT size=5><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.15pt">培训时间：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt">2017</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="LETTER-SPACING: -2.5pt"> </SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -2.5pt">年 </SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>3<SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -2.5pt"> </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -2.5pt">月 </SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>15<SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -2.3pt"> </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -2.3pt">日</SPAN>（<SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.15pt">周三</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt">）</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt">下午，</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.25pt">13</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.25pt">：<SPAN lang=EN-US>10</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.85pt"> </SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.85pt">前报到。</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt">培训地点：绍兴市聋哑学校</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.25pt">（</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.65pt">缪家桥河沿 </SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>9<SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -1.8pt"> </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -1.8pt">号</SPAN>）<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<H2 style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 39.1pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT face="Microsoft JhengHei">二、培训主题<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></H2>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="MARGIN: 1.25pt 0cm 0pt 38.85pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 19.9pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT face=宋体><FONT size=5>体验特殊学校教学<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<H2 style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 39.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 26.85pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT face="Microsoft JhengHei">三、具体安排：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></H2>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="MARGIN: 1.25pt 0cm 0pt 38.85pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT face=宋体><FONT size=5><SPAN lang=EN-US>1.</SPAN>参观校园；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="MARGIN: 3pt 0cm 0pt 38.85pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT face=宋体><FONT size=5><SPAN lang=EN-US>2.</SPAN>听单多英校长做专题报告；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="MARGIN: 3pt 0cm 0pt 38.85pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 19.9pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT face=宋体><FONT size=5><SPAN lang=EN-US>3.</SPAN>随班听课。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<H2 style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 39.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 26.85pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT face="Microsoft JhengHei">四、有关说明<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></H2>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="MARGIN: 1.25pt 0cm 0pt 38.85pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT size=5><FONT face=宋体><SPAN lang=EN-US>1.</SPAN>请各校及时通知新教师，准时参加实践培训活动；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="MARGIN: 3.05pt 0cm 0pt 38.85pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT size=5><FONT face=宋体><SPAN lang=EN-US>2.</SPAN>请随带笔记，认真听讲，作业完成<SPAN lang=EN-US> 800 </SPAN>字的感想。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="MARGIN: 3.05pt 38.8pt 0pt 38.85pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT size=5><FONT face=宋体><SPAN lang=EN-US>3<SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt">.</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt">不详事宜请与徐伟英老师联系，联系电话 </SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>88905982</SPAN>。<SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -2.7pt">附：《</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.15pt">2016</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt"> </SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt">年市直新教师实践培训分组听课名单》<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="MARGIN: 0.4pt 0cm 0pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 18.5pt"><o:p><FONT face=宋体> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
